30f&oh=00_AQSZKTDlahJVoF0KH_5BJQxjMO4qMUZsx6lAL4lGpEkSmA&oe=6B0C5C7C"}, {"file_name": "ApocalypseArenaCar_Meta_20260925_095226_325.png", "id": "1126402296927910", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908842261_1126402300261243_1815514664401206440_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tpA_kfoYF-oQ7kNvwG_F7OW&_nc_oc=AdoAoVbxfw_jvQgd8vWUML9futxrWigDysj-j2CMd9GQXbArq-XR0sTtkl8WrISsKEc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQUKcNTIxNuQTyU-Ao9Q2NQWfD_bZCaapWdMkMcShvttg&oe=6B0C816F"}, {"file_name": "ApocalypseArenaCar_Meta_20260925_095840_528.png", "id": "2030868520936014", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908842256_2030868524269347_3304920694707037822_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m7-J45z6y2cQ7kNvwGZzO5D&_nc_oc=AdqVBMIYSuvTj1IaKKMIXH3779KwNQ9X4lsH267k5lwtg6NpetHzRidp25d951-RKZg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSPeQdhsjETd8WSIw-oq6cmjuotiHWLDth7A5hoHW8ejA&oe=6B0C70CE"}, {"file_name": "com.leafandlight.carcrasharena-20260810-081757-2560x1440.png", "id": "1006833615712947", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/766240932_1006833619046280_2584089611186508700_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qu6fgNaZQe8Q7kNvwFDAaE2&_nc_oc=AdoTWRw60qyyHAnjY_0o3PpgpHLH0NnHQgUcIe_auDXuWQDTHCfrfy-3yIWPOm7_Tv8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRFNzJMpBVP82s-Lu6N5vIJAZIlw7JC0L255qG5w_pRcA&oe=6B0C4B40"}, {"file_name": "ApocalypseArenaCar_Meta_20260925_095425_453.png", "id": "1669308448173414", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908842260_1669308451506747_2190862736683067693_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TKaKYmpTpyoQ7kNvwFATt2s&_nc_oc=Adoy0eFnstYduo541n9BXoeMzQ9SVFa-9KoVe_PDgKU1MZZrkmywdbMHKHCNp-Gze4s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTkfkX4__49ILYwSI4QuKS1jIb-pV9CrVucl9XW7LoyoQ&oe=6B0C5424"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Image Sequence_044_0009.png", "id": "1303495935267871", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312310_1303495938601204_6101607894595342530_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qn26rOjaMRMQ7kNvwHoRZhv&_nc_oc=AdoFjZ_M0lXV2E7SimcjiV50cFURQgofvVhJSF0Cu47dlZpD2Teyi6iWTLg2_GG6hfQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQ8bhXjzzwdL5BGLrSifEu33Lzrqf68ktF97LlBgiBzfg&oe=6B0C5C36"}, "display_name": "Car Crash Arena: Demolition Derby", "keywords": ["combat", "zombies", "driving", "shooter", "destruction"], "long_description": "WELCOME TO DEADLOCK CITY\n\nEnter Deadlock City's vehicle-combat tournament, broadcast by Barnaby Boone, owner and voice of Arena Radio.\n\nChoose your car, step into the VR cockpit, and survive escalating waves of rival drivers, zombies, and the dangerous Agents of Chaos. Ram enemies into traps, fire mounted weapons, use nitro, dodge bombs and cranes, and stay out of the acid.\n\n{1323862079544884}\n\nBUILD YOUR COMBAT CAR\n\nUnlock vehicles and equip spikes, guns, flares, damage boosts, and survival upgrades. Create a build focused on damage, control, or endurance.\n\n{1594360845441526}\n\nCLIMB THE LEADERBOARDS\n\nFight through short, replayable runs, improve your score, and compete on Global and Friends leaderboards.\n\n{28962886803299796}\n\nFEATURES\n\n\u2022 First-person VR cockpit driving\n\u2022 Arcade demolition and vehicle combat\n\u2022 Rival drivers, Agents of Chaos, and zombies\n\u2022 Weapons, nitro, upgrades, traps, and moving hazards\n\u2022 Physics-driven crashes, flips, and explosions\n\u2022 Seated or standing play\n\u2022 Co-op mode coming soon\n\n{1998673274183767}\n{1556336889137256}\n\nCar Crash Arena is in Early Access and continues to grow through updates, including new arenas, Racing Mode, vehicles, upgrades, and gameplay improvements.\n\n{1640774564265454}\n\nWelcome to Deadlock City. Survive the tournament and earn your place among its champions.\n\n{1514434543770239}\n{1084955644221076}\n{907329338589421}\n", "short_description": "Demolition derby meets car combat in VR! Grab the wheel in a first-person cockpit and crash, smash and shoot your way through 3 deadly arenas: fire, acid and chaos. Survive waves of rival drivers, zombies and bosses with mounted guns, spikes and nitro. Unlock cars, upgrade weapons and armor, and build your ultimate battle car. Physics-driven crashes, flips and explosions, Free Roam driving and global leaderboards. Welcome to Deadlock City!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1367808271987926", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Car Crash Arena: Derby de d\u00e9molition", "keywords": ["combat", "zombies", "conduite", "tir", "destruction"], "long_description": "BIENVENUE \u00c0 DEADLOCK CITY\n\nEntrez dans le tournoi de combat automobile de Deadlock City, comment\u00e9 par Barnaby Boone, voix d'Arena Radio.\n\nChoisissez votre voiture, montez dans le cockpit VR et survivez \u00e0 des vagues de pilotes rivaux, de zombies et d'Agents du Chaos. Poussez vos ennemis dans les pi\u00e8ges, tirez, utilisez la nitro, \u00e9vitez bombes et grues, et fuyez l'acide.\n\n{1323862079544884}\n\nCONSTRUISEZ VOTRE VOITURE DE COMBAT\n\nD\u00e9bloquez des v\u00e9hicules et \u00e9quipez pointes, armes, fus\u00e9es, bonus de d\u00e9g\u00e2ts et am\u00e9liorations de survie. Misez sur les d\u00e9g\u00e2ts, le contr\u00f4le ou l'endurance.\n\n{1594360845441526}\n\nGRIMPEZ DANS LES CLASSEMENTS\n\nEncha\u00eenez des parties courtes et rejouables, am\u00e9liorez votre score et affrontez le monde et vos amis dans les classements.\n\n{28962886803299796}\n\nCARACT\u00c9RISTIQUES\n\n\u2022 Conduite en VR depuis le cockpit, \u00e0 la premi\u00e8re personne\n\u2022 D\u00e9molition arcade et combat de v\u00e9hicules\n\u2022 Pilotes rivaux, Agents du Chaos et zombies\n\u2022 Armes, nitro, am\u00e9liorations, pi\u00e8ges et dangers mobiles\n\u2022 Collisions, tonneaux et explosions g\u00e9r\u00e9s par la physique\n\u2022 Jouable assis ou debout\n\u2022 Mode coop\u00e9ratif \u00e0 venir\n\n{1998673274183767}\n{1556336889137256}\n\nCar Crash Arena est en acc\u00e8s anticip\u00e9 et s'enrichit \u00e0 chaque mise \u00e0 jour : nouvelles ar\u00e8nes, mode Course, v\u00e9hicules et am\u00e9liorations.\n\n{1640774564265454}\n\nBienvenue \u00e0 Deadlock City. Survivez au tournoi et gagnez votre place parmi ses champions.\n\n{1514434543770239}\n{1084955644221076}\n{907329338589421}\n", "short_description": "Le derby de d\u00e9molition rencontre le combat automobile en VR ! Prenez le volant en vue cockpit et foncez, percutez et tirez \u00e0 travers 3 ar\u00e8nes mortelles : feu, acide et chaos. Survivez aux vagues de pilotes rivaux, de zombies et de boss avec armes embarqu\u00e9es, pointes et nitro. D\u00e9bloquez des voitures, am\u00e9liorez armes et blindage, et cr\u00e9ez votre bolide de combat. Collisions, tonneaux et explosions physiques, conduite en Free Roam et classements mondiaux. Bienvenue \u00e0 Deadlock City !"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1158927413554745", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Car Crash Arena: Demolition Derby", "keywords": ["Kampf", "Zombies", "Fahren", "Shooter", "Zerst\u00f6rung"], "long_description": "WILLKOMMEN IN DEADLOCK CITY\n\nTritt beim Fahrzeugkampf-Turnier von Deadlock City an, live kommentiert von Barnaby Boone, Besitzer und Stimme von Arena Radio.\n\nW\u00e4hle dein Auto, steig ins VR-Cockpit und \u00fcberlebe immer h\u00e4rtere Wellen von Rivalen, Zombies und den Agenten des Chaos. Ramme Gegner in Fallen, feuere deine Waffen ab, z\u00fcnde Nitro, weiche Bomben und Kr\u00e4nen aus und meide die S\u00e4ure.\n\n{1323862079544884}\n\nBAU DEIN KAMPFAUTO\n\nSchalte Fahrzeuge frei und r\u00fcste Spikes, Schusswaffen, Leuchtraketen, Schadensboosts und \u00dcberlebens-Upgrades aus. Erstelle einen Build f\u00fcr Schaden, Kontrolle oder Ausdauer.\n\n{1594360845441526}\n\nERKLIMME DIE BESTENLISTEN\n\nK\u00e4mpfe dich durch kurze, wiederspielbare Runs, verbessere deinen Score und miss dich in globalen und Freundes-Bestenlisten.\n\n{28962886803299796}\n\nFEATURES\n\n\u2022 VR-Fahren im Cockpit aus der Ego-Perspektive\n\u2022 Arcade-Demolition und Fahrzeugkampf\n\u2022 Rivalisierende Fahrer, Agenten des Chaos und Zombies\n\u2022 Waffen, Nitro, Upgrades, Fallen und bewegliche Gefahren\n\u2022 Physikbasierte Crashs, \u00dcberschl\u00e4ge und Explosionen\n\u2022 Im Sitzen oder Stehen spielbar\n\u2022 Koop-Modus kommt bald\n\n{1998673274183767}\n{1556336889137256}\n\nCar Crash Arena ist im Early Access und w\u00e4chst mit jedem Update: neue Arenen, Rennmodus, Fahrzeuge und Upgrades.\n\n{1640774564265454}\n\nWillkommen in Deadlock City. \u00dcberlebe das Turnier und verdiene dir deinen Platz unter den Champions.\n\n{1514434543770239}\n{1084955644221076}\n{907329338589421}\n", "short_description": "Demolition Derby trifft Auto-Kampf in VR! Greif im Cockpit aus der Ego-Perspektive ins Lenkrad und crashe, ramme und schie\u00dfe dich durch 3 t\u00f6dliche Arenen: Feuer, S\u00e4ure und Chaos. \u00dcberlebe Wellen von rivalisierenden Fahrern, Zombies und Bossen mit montierten Waffen, Spikes und Nitro. Schalte Autos frei, verbessere Waffen und Panzerung und baue dein ultimatives Kampfauto. Physikbasierte Crashs, \u00dcberschl\u00e4ge und Explosionen, Free Roam und globale Bestenlisten. Willkommen in Deadlock City!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://leafandlight.github.io/car-crash-arena-site/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Leaf and Light Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://leafandlight.github.io/car-crash-arena-site/", "category"